{"title":"Daniele Antonioli Blog","url":"https://francozappa.github.io/","favicon":"https://francozappa.github.io/media/icon_hufd6449924b8771808a89b636be1cd7b0_295644_32x32_fill_lanczos_center_3.png","elements":[{"title":"CTRAPS interview on Off By One Security","contents":"<div class=\"media-body\">\n\n    <div class=\"section-subheading article-title mb-0 mt-0\">\n      <a href=\"/post/2025/ctraps-offbyone/\">CTRAPS interview on Off By One Security</a>\n    </div>\n\n    \n    <a href=\"/post/2025/ctraps-offbyone/\" class=\"summary-link\">\n      <div class=\"article-style\">\n        Marco and I talked about CTRAPS with Stephen Sims from Off By One Security about CTRAPS: CTAP Impersonation and API Confusion on FIDO2.\nThank you Stephen and Randall for inviting us and keep up with the awesome content in your YouTube channel!\n      </div>\n    </a>\n    \n\n    <div class=\"stream-meta article-metadata\">\n\n      \n\n      \n        \n\n\n<div class=\"article-metadata\">\n\n  \n  \n\n  \n  <span class=\"article-date\">\n    \n    \n      \n    \n    Sep 22, 2025\n  </span>\n  \n\n  \n\n  \n  <span class=\"middot-divider\"></span>\n  <span class=\"article-reading-time\">\n    1 min read\n  </span>\n  \n\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    <span class=\"middot-divider\"></span>\n    <a href=\"/post/2025/ctraps-offbyone/#disqus_thread\">0 Comments</a>\n  \n\n  \n  \n\n</div>\n\n      \n    </div>\n\n    \n\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"ml-3\">\n    \n    \n  </div>","link":"https://francozappa.github.io/post/2025/ctraps-offbyone/","retrieved":1758499200000},{"title":"CTRAPS at Euro S&P'25 and DEF CON 33","contents":"<div class=\"media-body\">\n\n    <div class=\"section-subheading article-title mb-0 mt-0\">\n      <a href=\"/post/2025/ctraps-eurosp25/\">CTRAPS at Euro S&amp;P'25 and DEF CON 33</a>\n    </div>\n\n    \n    <a href=\"/post/2025/ctraps-eurosp25/\" class=\"summary-link\">\n      <div class=\"article-style\">\n        This week we presented at IEEE Euro S&amp;P'25 CTRAPS: CTAP Impersonation and API Confusion on FIDO2, a paper about the security and privacy of FIDO2, a widespread standard used for single-factor and multi-factor authentication.\n      </div>\n    </a>\n    \n\n    <div class=\"stream-meta article-metadata\">\n\n      \n\n      \n        \n\n\n<div class=\"article-metadata\">\n\n  \n  \n\n  \n  <span class=\"article-date\">\n    \n    \n      \n    \n    Jul 4, 2025\n  </span>\n  \n\n  \n\n  \n  <span class=\"middot-divider\"></span>\n  <span class=\"article-reading-time\">\n    2 min read\n  </span>\n  \n\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    <span class=\"middot-divider\"></span>\n    <a href=\"/post/2025/ctraps-eurosp25/#disqus_thread\">0 Comments</a>\n  \n\n  \n  \n\n</div>\n\n      \n    </div>\n\n    \n\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"ml-3\">\n    \n    \n  </div>","link":"https://francozappa.github.io/post/2025/ctraps-eurosp25/","retrieved":1751587200000},{"title":"NDSS'26 Artifact Evaluation Comitee Self-Nomination","contents":"<div class=\"media-body\">\n\n    <div class=\"section-subheading article-title mb-0 mt-0\">\n      <a href=\"/post/2025/ae-ndss26/\">NDSS'26 Artifact Evaluation Comitee Self-Nomination</a>\n    </div>\n\n    \n    <a href=\"/post/2025/ae-ndss26/\" class=\"summary-link\">\n      <div class=\"article-style\">\n        Mathy Vanhoef and I are co-chairing NDSS'26 Artifact Evaluation (AE).\nWe are looking for motivated PhD and Postdocs to self-nominate themselves for the NDSS'26 Artifact Evaluation Committee (AEC). Joining it would offer them practical experience and may ease developing artifact submissions for their papers.\n      </div>\n    </a>\n    \n\n    <div class=\"stream-meta article-metadata\">\n\n      \n\n      \n        \n\n\n<div class=\"article-metadata\">\n\n  \n  \n\n  \n  <span class=\"article-date\">\n    \n    \n      \n    \n    Jun 13, 2025\n  </span>\n  \n\n  \n\n  \n  <span class=\"middot-divider\"></span>\n  <span class=\"article-reading-time\">\n    1 min read\n  </span>\n  \n\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    <span class=\"middot-divider\"></span>\n    <a href=\"/post/2025/ae-ndss26/#disqus_thread\">0 Comments</a>\n  \n\n  \n  \n\n</div>\n\n      \n    </div>\n\n    \n\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"ml-3\">\n    \n    \n  </div>","link":"https://francozappa.github.io/post/2025/ae-ndss26/","retrieved":1749772800000},{"title":"KNOB Attack and Crypto 101 by Alfred Menezes","contents":"<div class=\"media-body\">\n\n    <div class=\"section-subheading article-title mb-0 mt-0\">\n      <a href=\"/post/2025/crypto101-knob/\">KNOB Attack and Crypto 101 by Alfred Menezes</a>\n    </div>\n\n    \n    <a href=\"/post/2025/crypto101-knob/\" class=\"summary-link\">\n      <div class=\"article-style\">\n        Alfred Menezes has published a fantastic online course on real-world cryptography called Crypto 101: Real-World Deployments.\nIt is an honor to be featured in the Bluetooth Security Lecture (Lecture 4) which talks about the KNOB attack.\n      </div>\n    </a>\n    \n\n    <div class=\"stream-meta article-metadata\">\n\n      \n\n      \n        \n\n\n<div class=\"article-metadata\">\n\n  \n  \n\n  \n  <span class=\"article-date\">\n    \n    \n      \n    \n    Apr 1, 2025\n  </span>\n  \n\n  \n\n  \n  <span class=\"middot-divider\"></span>\n  <span class=\"article-reading-time\">\n    1 min read\n  </span>\n  \n\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    <span class=\"middot-divider\"></span>\n    <a href=\"/post/2025/crypto101-knob/#disqus_thread\">0 Comments</a>\n  \n\n  \n  \n\n</div>\n\n      \n    </div>\n\n    \n\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"ml-3\">\n    \n    \n  </div>","link":"https://francozappa.github.io/post/2025/crypto101-knob/","retrieved":1743465600000},{"title":"CFP: ACSW 2025","contents":"<div class=\"media-body\">\n\n    <div class=\"section-subheading article-title mb-0 mt-0\">\n      <a href=\"/post/2025/cfp-acsw25/\">CFP: ACSW 2025</a>\n    </div>\n\n    \n    <a href=\"/post/2025/cfp-acsw25/\" class=\"summary-link\">\n      <div class=\"article-style\">\n        The call for papers for the 4th Workshop on Automotive Cyber Security (ACSW) co-located with IEEE EuroS&amp;P 2025 is closing today, Feb 3rd AoE. Please submit your automotive security work!\n      </div>\n    </a>\n    \n\n    <div class=\"stream-meta article-metadata\">\n\n      \n\n      \n        \n\n\n<div class=\"article-metadata\">\n\n  \n  \n\n  \n  <span class=\"article-date\">\n    \n    \n      \n    \n    Feb 3, 2025\n  </span>\n  \n\n  \n\n  \n  <span class=\"middot-divider\"></span>\n  <span class=\"article-reading-time\">\n    1 min read\n  </span>\n  \n\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    <span class=\"middot-divider\"></span>\n    <a href=\"/post/2025/cfp-acsw25/#disqus_thread\">0 Comments</a>\n  \n\n  \n  \n\n</div>\n\n      \n    </div>\n\n    \n\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"ml-3\">\n    \n    \n  </div>","link":"https://francozappa.github.io/post/2025/cfp-acsw25/","retrieved":1738540800000}]}